source: crates/ruff_linter/src/rules/odoo/mod.rs
---
ODOO023 Same Odoo module absolute import. You should use relative import with "." instead of "odoo.addons.my_module"
 --> foo.py:1:1
  |
1 | from odoo.addons.my_module import models as _models
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
2 | from odoo.addons.my_module.models import foo as _foo
3 | from odoo.addons.other_module import models as _other
  |

ODOO023 Same Odoo module absolute import. You should use relative import with "." instead of "odoo.addons.my_module"
 --> foo.py:2:1
  |
1 | from odoo.addons.my_module import models as _models
2 | from odoo.addons.my_module.models import foo as _foo
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
3 | from odoo.addons.other_module import models as _other
  |
